        "jsCode": "\nconst ALLOW_STAGE_WRITES=false; // ALWAYS false until live reconciliation, retry and idempotency tests succeed.\nconst p=$('Prepare | Stage Decision Audit').first().json;\nif(!ALLOW_STAGE_WRITES || p.decision?.action!=='apply')return [];\nif(!p.identity_verified||!p.note_verified)return [];\nreturn [{json:p}];\n"
